{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"1ee2e4dfbd61761bfa4ac64c7e042de9841cb150249d794b7ffc64d233078b70","ja":"戸惑いテレフォン","zh":"困惑的电话","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6d972ab79f0a3e67e342d99429855eb9fb59925431f3fa14a4fb85efe7ce44a3","ja":"収録お疲れさまっ！　お仕事でまた\nウェディングトークができて楽しかったね♪","zh":"录制辛苦啦！能在工作里又聊到\n婚礼的话题，真的很开心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5ae3e126124dfb7d8b617980a820308be866a6046f324b56cb039f501912e5cb","ja":"はい、とても。……ところで宮尾さんは\nどちらに行かれたのでしょう？","zh":"是的，非常满意。……话说回来，宫尾小姐\n去哪里了呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"90bc0927bb249c6e285b630cf733657afb1b8e0e24fd6c8748801aba45259b36","ja":"さっきまで一緒だったのにね。\nなんかあったのかな……私、探してくるね！","zh":"刚才明明还在一起的。\n是发生什么事了吗……我去四处找找看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ad8adca56f4a99b87ab15e74a932185de0205df50fe91b3efe8cbcadc7f2ea9f","ja":"（あ、いたいた……あれ？\nなんだ、電話中だったんだ～。じゃあまた後で……）","zh":"（啊，找到了……咦？\n什么嘛，原来在打电话啊～。那还是待会儿再……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9828195efb5e76b8af844fd74aaa9bb83926d26bc8d31ee32962ed20ce7566ee","ja":"おお～。では婚約は、あの日で決定ですね～♪\nはい～、私は大丈夫ですよ～。","zh":"哦哦～。那订婚就定在那一天了呢～♪\n好的～，我没问题哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"338c724ea6fe50bb05c3f99faa486c0a82b188b29543340f268f6b9c21bc13f5","ja":"（へっ！？　こ、婚約！？\n……って、美也が～～～！？）","zh":"（诶！？订、订婚！？\n……等等，是美也～～～！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f97c6f29fce516daa6602ab3f60b3764eec5c87564fefa85a87ececaafe98d06","ja":"お帰りなさい。\n宮尾さんは見つかりましたか？","zh":"欢迎回来。\n找到宫尾小姐了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4034393e07e95206063ccbeaeb02e33e3564278b431c6c44c4da71057850df51","ja":"う、うん。電話中だったみたい。\nそれでね、その……！","zh":"嗯、嗯。好像正在打电话。\n然后呢，那个……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"62c5900d6eb6f444d65eebfba1fd75258663882904ee61ffaf7f9f71659d58b6","ja":"お疲れさまでした～。","zh":"辛苦了～","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"ada38175bc1ac000f339627cfd67f9862d7f391171bcff4f1bb9fcab21fa1317","ja":"あっ、宮尾さん。急にいなくなったと思ったのですが、\n電話だったそうですね。","zh":"啊，宫尾。我还以为你突然去哪儿了呢，\n原来是去接电话了啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"634860c01f2ab0010543076a7d3b3013b7efbb9570284b2cd3a960444a9562f6","ja":"はい～。とっても嬉しいお話をしてきました～♪","zh":"好～的。聊了非常让人开心的事情哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1257.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"fc95cddaa5dca9a20a30a68fe46e047877ba1ae146e93f65b703524d1bbe7a24","ja":"（なんかすっごく幸せそう！？\nも、もしかして本当に……美也、婚約するの！？）","zh":"（感觉超级幸福的样子！？\n难道说真的……美也，要订婚了吗！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
